@startuml
title Task: a step on a build, opened by the contractor, ticked by the worker
[*] --> todo : contractor opens a task (133)
todo --> done : worker ticks (137)
done --> todo : worker unticks (138)
todo --> skipped : worker skips (140)
skipped --> todo : worker unskips (139)
todo -[dotted]-> done : contractor cannot tick (148)
@enduml
